   1:Source/render/decoders/psd.c **** /*
   2:Source/render/decoders/psd.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — psd.c
   3:Source/render/decoders/psd.c ****  * PSD decoder (see psd.h). Parses the header, color-mode block and the
   4:Source/render/decoders/psd.c ****  * image-data section at the end of the file (layers/resources skipped by
   5:Source/render/decoders/psd.c ****  * walking their length fields). Channel planes arrive planar (R all rows,
   6:Source/render/decoders/psd.c ****  * then G, then B...) either raw or per-row PackBits. Alpha (4th channel) is
   7:Source/render/decoders/psd.c ****  * skipped for gray conversion (over transparent background Photoshop composites
   8:Source/render/decoders/psd.c ****  * onto white when exporting, which the benchmark pattern uses).
   9:Source/render/decoders/psd.c ****  */
